{
  "STS2_WINE_FOX_ADDONS_EVENT_MIDNIGHT_DINER.title": "深夜食堂",
  "STS2_WINE_FOX_ADDONS_EVENT_MIDNIGHT_DINER.pages.INITIAL.description": "一股[gold]热油[/gold]的香气顺着巷子飘过来。你循着它拐过墙角，看见一扇没关严的木门，门缝里漏出[orange]昏黄的灯光[/orange]，还有铁勺刮过锅底的声响。\n\n店里只有一张台子。灶前站着个[green]狐耳厨娘[/green]，背对着你，始终没有回头。\n\n[b]“坐吧。吃点什么？”[/b]",
  "STS2_WINE_FOX_ADDONS_EVENT_MIDNIGHT_DINER.pages.INITIAL.options.EAT_HEARTILY.title": "饱餐一顿",
  "STS2_WINE_FOX_ADDONS_EVENT_MIDNIGHT_DINER.pages.INITIAL.options.EAT_HEARTILY.description": "回复[green]{HealPercent}%[/green]的最大生命值。",
